# What the viewer can show, in one pass: orbit, plan, illuminance on every
# surface, and the field draped over the geometry.
#
# The orbit is deliberately small. The enclosure is open only toward -y, so
# swinging much past 30 degrees puts the camera outside it looking at the back
# of a wall, and the tour spends its best frames on a black canvas.
wait 6000
record tour 200

drag 470 330 512 318 1200   # drag empty canvas to orbit
wait 500
drag 512 318 452 334 1200   # and back the other way
wait 700

key 2                       # orthographic plan
wait 2800
key 3                       # illuminance on every surface
wait 4000
key 1                       # the same shading, back in perspective
wait 4000

key 3                       # shading off
key F                       # drape the measured field on the geometry instead
wait 3600
stop
